d 'MSRRD': module to compute Risk Ratio and Risk Difference estimation using Marginal standardisation (G-computation) method
d
d  This routine Computes Risk Ratio (RR) and Risk Difference (RD)
d using Marginal standardisation (G-computation) method (see
d margins). Standard errors and 95% CI's are computed using the
d delta-method (see nlcom). The command will also displays n/N (%)
d by group (and for each subgroup if subgroup option selected). 
d
d KW: risk ratio
d KW: risk difference
d KW: marginal standardization 
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author:  Samir Mehta ,   Birmingham Clinical Trials Unit (BCTU), University of Birmingham
d Support: email  s.mehta.1@@bham.ac.uk
d
f msrrd.ado
f msrrd.sthlp
